OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died in four-vehicle crash
OL,4,Ais named
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe person who died in a four-vehicle
OL,7,Fcrash in Newry has been named as
OL,8,F23-year-old Dylan McCann.
OL,10,FThe crash, involving a lorry, van and
OL,11,Ftwo cars, happened on Monday morning at
OL,12,Fthe junction between the Armagh Road
OL,13,Fand Church Road.
OL,15,FMcCann, from Cookstown, was driving one
OL,16,Fof the cars and died at the scene. Two
OL,17,Fpeople were taken to hospital with
OL,18,Fserious injuries.
OL,20,FDet Insp Stewart, from the collision
OL,21,Finvestigation unit, said the report
OL,22,Fcame in at 06:30 BST.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
